<view class="manage-page page-with-tab">
  <view class="manage-hero">
    <view class="mh-main">
      <view class="mh-kicker">{{isSuper ? '超级用户' : '商家'}}工作台</view>
      <view class="mh-title">{{nickname || '小张的餐厅'}}</view>
      <view class="mh-desc">订单、采购、菜品与食材都在这里；进入小程序仍从点餐开始。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="mh-badge">{{isSuper ? '超管' : '商家'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-line">正在确认权限…</view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state-block">
    <view class="state-mark">!</view>
    <view class="state-title">管理页没有加载出来</view>
    <view class="state-desc">{{error}}</view>
    <view class="state-action" bindtap="retry">重新加载</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="key" class="entry-group">
      <view class="section-head">
        <text class="title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="more">{{item.hint}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="card entry-list">
        <view
          wx:for="{{item.items}}"
          wx:for-item="entry"
          wx:key="key"
          class="entry-row"
          bindtap="openEntry"
          data-url="{{entry.url}}"
        >
          <view class="er-ic {{entry.tone}}">{{entry.glyph}}</view>
          <view class="er-main">
            <view class="er-title">{{entry.title}}</view>
            <view class="er-desc">{{entry.desc}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="chevron right"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="manage-note">
      商家端权限由超级用户在「用户授权」中开关，撤销后立即生效。若权限被关闭，页面会自动回到点餐，不会停留在无权页面。
    </view>
  </block>
</view>

<tab-bar merchant="{{hasMerchant}}" active="manage" />
